<title>AUSTRALIA: AUSTRALIA FACES CHALLENGING TASK ON JOBLESS-GOVT.</title>
<headline>AUSTRALIA FACES CHALLENGING TASK ON JOBLESS-GOVT.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia faced a challenging task in cutting its stubbornly high unemployment rate, acting Prime Minister Tim Fischer said on Thursday.</p>
<p>He was commenting after official data showed unemployment increased to 8.7 percent in July from 8.5 percent a month earlier.</p>
</text>
